{"id":"f64995a6895fada9","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Cardinal8 Remarkable Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Remarkable Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Remarkable Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","[[58-df-critical-point]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal — ZFC Cardinal8 Remarkable Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"58-df-elementary-embedding\">58-df-elementary-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"327fc5339902933e\" href=\"?note=327fc5339902933e\" title=\"58-df-critical-point\">58-df-critical-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\bar\\lambda,\\gamma,j,\\mathbb P_\\kappa,1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,\\bar\\lambda,\\gamma,j,\\mathbb P_\\kappa,1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P_\\kappa=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\omega,{&lt;}\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathbb P_\\kappa=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\omega,{&lt;}\\kappa)\\)</span> is the set-coded Lévy collapse with greatest condition <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\">\\(1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Remarkable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Remarkable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic unary schema defined below; it is intentionally not declared as a set predicate</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}remarkable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Remarkable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\n\\exists\\bar\\lambda,\\gamma,j\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bar\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S^{V}(\\bar\\lambda)\n\\land\\gamma\\in\\bar\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,H_{\\bar\\lambda}^{V},H_\\lambda^{V})\n\\land\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S\n(\\gamma,j,H_{\\bar\\lambda}^{V},H_\\lambda^{V})\n\\land j(\\gamma)=\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}remarkable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Remarkable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\n1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\n\\exists\\bar\\lambda,\\gamma,j\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bar\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S^{V}(\\bar\\lambda)\n\\land\\gamma\\in\\bar\\lambda\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,H_{\\bar\\lambda}^{V},H_\\lambda^{V})\n\\land\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S\n(\\gamma,j,H_{\\bar\\lambda}^{V},H_\\lambda^{V})\n\\land j(\\gamma)=\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Remarkability is virtual: the witnessing elementary embedding exists after the Lévy collapse.  Requiring the embedding already in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> defines a much stronger and different property.</li>\n<li>The displayed forcing assertion is explicitly metatheoretic. The registered six-place <code>ForcingRelation_S</code> accepts only a set-coded ground model, formula code, name tuple, carrier, and order; applying it to the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> as the former formula did was an object/meta-level type error. A set-model-relative version must instead supply all six of those arguments.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-critical-point","status":"resolved","id":"327fc5339902933e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-critical-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,\\bar\\lambda,\\gamma,j,\\mathbb P_\\kappa,1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P_\\kappa=\\operatorname{Coll}(\\omega,{<}\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Remarkable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}remarkable\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Remarkable}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\forall\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land\\kappa\\in\\lambda\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\n1_{\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\\Vdash_{\\mathrm{meta},\\mathbb P_\\kappa}\n\\exists\\bar\\lambda,\\gamma,j\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bar\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\land\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S^{V}(\\bar\\lambda)\n\\land\\gamma\\in\\bar\\lambda\\\\\n&\\hspace{15em}\\land\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,H_{\\bar\\lambda}^{V},H_\\lambda^{V})\n\\land\\mathrm{CriticalPoint}_S\n(\\gamma,j,H_{\\bar\\lambda}^{V},H_\\lambda^{V})\n\\land j(\\gamma)=\\kappa\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":2337,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1533","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-cardinal8-remarkable-cardinal]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","a25c0a66cf56c0f4","327fc5339902933e","0fbfc19800246e77"]}